---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description:
		"About Varun Gupta — Master's student in Computer Science at IIIT Hyderabad working on visual understanding and representation learning.",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12 text-4xl sm:text-5xl">About</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<img
			src="/img/prof_pic.jpg"
			alt="Profile picture of Varun Gupta"
			class="float-right ms-4 mb-4 w-48 sm:w-72"
		/>
		<p>
			I’m a Master’s student in Computer Science at
			<a class="cactus-link inline-block" href="https://www.iiit.ac.in/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
				>IIIT Hyderabad</a
			>, where I work on visual understanding and representation learning — essentially, teaching
			computers how to watch and make sense of the world!
		</p>
		<p>
			I’m fortunate to be advised by
			<a class="cactus-link inline-block" href="https://makarandtapaswi.github.io/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
				>Dr. Makarand Tapaswi</a
			> and
			<a class="cactus-link inline-block" href="https://faculty.iiit.ac.in/~jawahar/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
				>Prof. C.V. Jawahar</a
			>, while collaborating closely with
			<a class="cactus-link inline-block" href="https://www.iiit.ac.in/faculty/vineet-gandhi/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
				>Dr. Vineet Gandhi</a
			>.
		</p>
		<p>
			<strong>Previously</strong>, I was a Research Fellow with the Mobility Group at CVIT,
			collaborating with
			<a
				class="cactus-link inline-block"
				href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/anbumanisubramanian/"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank">Dr. Anbumani Subramanian</a
			> (Intel) on an autonomous driving project, tackling road infrastructure challenges in
			unconstrained environments. During my <strong>undergrad</strong>, I interned at
			<a class="cactus-link inline-block" href="https://www.nitgoa.ac.in/" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">NIT Goa</a
			>, where I worked with
			<a
				class="cactus-link inline-block"
				href="https://www.nitgoa.ac.in/People/frontend/lalat.html"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank">Dr. Lalat Indu Giri</a
			> on contactless respiratory rate monitoring using infrared thermography.
		</p>
		<p>
			Beyond research, you’ll find me cooking, biking around, vibing to music, capturing moments, or
			lifting some heavy weights!
		</p>
	</div>
	<figure class="text-muted mt-16 text-sm italic">
		<blockquote>“A smooth sea never made a skilled sailor.”</blockquote>
		<figcaption class="mt-1">— Franklin D. Roosevelt</figcaption>
	</figure>
</PageLayout>